# terminal — Agent Instructions

Read `packages/apps/terminal/CLAUDE.md` first. This is the React frontend.

## Key Facts
- Port: 5173 (Vite dev server)
- Framework: React 19 + TypeScript 5.x strict
- Layout: Dockview v5.1 (widget-composable, NOT fixed modules)
- Components: shadcn/ui + Radix (accessible, copy-paste ownership)
- State: Zustand 5 (UI) + Jotai (market data atoms) + TanStack Query 5 (REST cache)
- Charting: Lightweight Charts v5
- Data grids: Glide Data Grid (streaming) + TanStack Table v8 (static)
- Branch: main (pre-release, all commits to main)

## Widgets (69 TSX)
Trading (15): under `src/widgets/trading/` — ActionCenter, Fills, Holdings, OrderLadder, OrderPad, Orders, PnLMonitor, PortfolioAllocation, Positions, QuickTrade, RiskDashboard, Scalper, SmartOrder, StrategyMonitor, TradeCopier.
Analysis (29): under `src/widgets/analysis/` — ArbitrageScanner, Chart, ConditionScanner, CorrelationMatrix, CorrelationPairs, DOMHeatmap, DeliveryData, GammaDensity, GapAnalysis, Greeks, GreeksHeatmap, HistoricalChain, IVSmile, InstrumentCompare, MarketOverview, MultiTimeframe, OIChart, OptionChain, OrderFlow, PCRTrend, PatternDetection, PivotPoints, PortfolioOptimiser, Straddle, StraddlePnL, TimeSales, VWAPBands, VolSurface, VolatilityCone.
Utility (21): under `src/widgets/utility/` — AIAdvisor, AIBackends, AITeam, Alerts, AuditTrail, Calculator, CurrencyConverter, EarningsCalendar, EconomicCalendar, ExpiryCountdown, FundingRate, IndexStrip, MarketClock, News, Obsidian, StrategyTemplates, TickSpeed, Ticker, TradeIdea, TradeJournal, Watchlist.
Also `src/widgets/orders/` and `src/widgets/account/`: 4 broker-order and reconciliation widgets.

## Tools (5)
Under `src/tools/`: BacktestLab, FlowBuilder, Settings, StrategyBuilder, TradeJournal.

## Routes (12 public + DEV `/admin` + 404)
/welcome, /explore, /setup, /setup-account, /settings, /home, /trade (with `/terminal` alias), /invest, /learn, /lab, /automate, /ai, /ditto. Plus DEV-only `/admin` and `*` 404 catch-all.

